<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Casino Data cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Casino Data cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw analyst Dan Devila said he downgraded Casino Data Systems to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Left 1997 estimate unchanged at $1.03 per share but also said, &quot;I don't feel like I have a good feel for what's happening over there and I think they've been lacking in managing the Street's expectations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3-1/2 to 9-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
